    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day 15 thousand people travel through Fujinomiya Station on their morning commute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tiny station becomes a rush of workers, students and travelers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some call it a storm of people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However before a single soul enters the station, a man comes to clean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the crack of the dawn when the world still sleeps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Calm Before the Storm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm Before the Storm is a retro japanese themed cleaning simulator game where you work as a cleaning employee working at dawn right before a storm of people arrive at the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is filled with interactive objects, extras and secrets for people wanting to fully experience and explore the game, there is multiple endings and an endless minigame where you can put your skills to test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mopping</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.poster.avif?t=1751376265\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.webm?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.mp4?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picking Up Trash</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/ec583563e44cd72ac72e516b44149601.poster.avif?t=1751376265\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/ec583563e44cd72ac72e516b44149601.webm?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/ec583563e44cd72ac72e516b44149601.mp4?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dumping Trash</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/69a682e6f76476287d083c2ba6fdb339.poster.avif?t=1751376265\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/69a682e6f76476287d083c2ba6fdb339.webm?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/69a682e6f76476287d083c2ba6fdb339.mp4?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleaning &amp; Polishing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/d869a13d10f39f62d4367823b03da220.poster.avif?t=1751376265\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/d869a13d10f39f62d4367823b03da220.webm?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/d869a13d10f39f62d4367823b03da220.mp4?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day 15 thousand people travel through Fujinomiya Station on their morning commute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tiny station becomes a rush of workers, students and travelers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some call it a storm of people</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However before a single soul enters the station, a man comes to clean</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the crack of the dawn when the world still sleeps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Calm Before the Storm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm Before the Storm is a retro japanese themed cleaning simulator game where you work as a cleaning employee working at dawn right before a storm of people arrive at the station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is filled with interactive objects, extras and secrets for people wanting to fully experience and explore the game, there is multiple endings and an endless minigame where you can put your skills to test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mopping</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.poster.avif?t=1751376265\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.webm?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542540/extras/e2e7de22c4bcafc6827d261eca88a7df.mp4?t=1751376265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"